== Effects ==
* Has a 1/6 chance to spawn a random [[locust]] when killing an enemy.
** Up to 4 White Locusts can be spawned from a single enemy.
* The trinket is not affected by [[luck]].

== Synergies ==
* {{a|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}}/ '''Cricket Leg''': The chance to spawn a locust increases to 1/3.
** Multiple copies of the trinket increase the chance by 1/6 per copy. At 6 copies, enemies are guaranteed to spawn locusts on death.
* {{I|Bomber Boy}}: [[Locust of War|Red locusts]] explode in a small horizontal cross-shape pattern.
* {{I|Brimstone Bombs}}: Red locusts will shoot out four brimstone beams in a + formation after hitting an enemy.
* {{I|Glitter Bombs}}: Red locust explosions have a chance to spawn pickups or trinkets.
* {{I|Hive Mind}}: Increases locusts' size and doubles their damage.
** Red locusts’ impact damage is doubled and the explosion damage is increased to 85.
* {{I|Sad Bombs}}: Red locusts fire a ring of ten tears outward upon detonation, which are affected by Isaac's tear modifiers, and deal damage equal to 15 + 0.6x, where x is Isaac's [[Damage]].

== Interactions ==
* {{dlc|r}}[[Cards and Runes|Ace Cards]]: Enemies that are turned into [[pickup]]s don’t spawn locusts.
* {{i|E. Coli}}/{{i|Flush!}}: Enemies that are turned into poop don't spawn locusts.

== Trivia ==
* Despite this trinket's name, as well as the locusts' in-game appearance, [[wikipedia:Locust#Swarming grasshoppers|real life locusts]] are "the swarming phase of certain species of short-horned grasshoppers".

